function parseMarkup(html,parent=new HtmlNode()){const stack=[parent];for(const token of String(html).match(/<[^>]*>|[^<]+/g)||[]){if(token.startsWith('</')){if(stack.length>1)stack.pop();continue;}if(token.startsWith('<')){const match=token.match(/^<([a-z][\w:-]*)([\s\S]*?)\/?\s*>$/i);if(!match)continue;const node=new HtmlNode(match[1]);for(const attr of match[2].matchAll(/([^\s=]+)(?:\s*=\s*(?:"([^"]*)"|'([^']*)'|([^\s>]+)))?/g))node.setAttribute(attr[1],decodeHtml(attr[2]??attr[3]??attr[4]??''));stack.at(-1).append(node);if(!/^(input|img|br|hr|meta|link|source)$/i.test(match[1])&&!token.endsWith('/>'))stack.push(node);}else{const node=new HtmlNode('#text');node._text=decodeHtml(token);stack.at(-1).append(node);}}return parent;}
